    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4b81b7e93f28d2f164433a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f38a26d2109e9836d01da3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，\r\n我要尽情地狂奔咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9b56ec14f3a9d3e3b451b16ce211aa0bf8b750d10caef38ffe97b1d817d694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d2047a65d9c24e6b06b18b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "引擎已经热起来了！\r\n你能跟上我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd59405cfc670d6989b6463b78cdcff2cbb5d56dce72f8d422214f26e2a89db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c77ead7ca122f266d4d4da88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊，训练员君！\r\n我今天也是\r\n整天都要把油门踩到底哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "77128709ecb237098600eba3cd25ac52fb1bb505d1e3706313bebfce364f20ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d2337b33062b3d8fee128d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要很有精神地迎接一整天\r\n的开始！那我们今天\r\n也尽全力加油加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad057ccf216066aa5377716bebcb7f5d7241437c1e407ec190c277f684452696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17be35570f438413ae9cf977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安！下午的训练\r\n也要打起精神努力进行哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03dc43dc2c369708923c3b7bbf5fa7223ba45cf35a74c85e0720ec1e3fadcfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:715dcf6c99e9294c5be1e25f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，训练员君。\r\n我已经做好要训练的准备了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d8495d7226a98c7d2d8a73b3a3520a4d5f939c5c2a446d6b958b2652dd1b64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
